Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: msime
Upstream-Contact: Metasequoia IME <metasequoiaime@gmail.com>
Source: https://github.com/metasequoiaime/msime
Comment:
 The upstream source is msime-VERSION.tar.xz from the linux-sources
 release. The component tarball msime_VERSION.orig-vendor.tar.xz (unpacked
 into vendor/) is msime-VERSION-vendor.tar.xz from the same release,
 generated by platforms/linux/packaging/make-source-tarballs.sh: the
 Rust crates resolved by Cargo.lock (cargo vendor), the settings window's
 web frontend built from apps/desktop with pnpm, and data files fetched and
 checked against the lock files in resources/.
 .
 platforms/linux/data/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt describes every component
 built into the binary package; the installed package carries it, the
 collected Rust crate and npm package notices and the component license
 texts in /usr/share/doc/msime-client.

