Files: crates/engine/src/local/chaizi.tsv crates/engine/src/local/chaizi-chars.tsv
Copyright: 2015 開放詞典 (http://www.kaifangcidian.com)
 1991-2026 Unicode, Inc.
 Carbo Kuo and the OpenCC contributors
License: CC-BY-3.0 and Unicode-3.0 and Apache-2.0
Comment:
 Adapted from chaizi-jt.txt and chaizi-ft.txt of https://github.com/kfcd/chaizi, commit e177ab54ce4edf255315a60593ffecbd8167e96b, with readings, ranks and traditional variants from Unihan 17.0.0 and OpenCC; resources/licenses/kfcd-chaizi-CC-BY-3.0.txt records the attribution and the changes.

Files: crates/engine/src/local/symbol_groups.tsv
Copyright: 1991-2026 Unicode, Inc.
License: Unicode-3.0
Comment:
 Group members chosen by scripts/build_symbol_groups.py from UnicodeData.txt, Blocks.txt and EquivalentUnifiedIdeograph.txt of the Unicode Character Database 17.0.0.

Files: crates/engine/src/local/latex_symbols.tsv
Copyright: 2026 Metasequoia IME contributors
License: MIT
Comment:
 This project's own LaTeX command table, compiled into the input engine; the license text is resources/licenses/latex-symbols-MIT.txt, installed with the binary package whether or not it carries the latex-symbols plugin pack.

Files: crates/engine/src/handwriting/model.rs crates/engine/src/handwriting/features.rs
Copyright: 2005-2007 Taku Kudo
 2026 Metasequoia IME contributors
License: MPL-2.0 and BSD-3-clause
Comment:
 Ported from zinnia (https://github.com/taku910/zinnia), commit 581faa8f; the license text is resources/licenses/Zinnia-LICENSE.txt.

Files: crates/engine/src/lattice/octagram.rs
Copyright: 2014 RIME Developers
 2008-2014 Susumu Yata
 2026 Metasequoia IME contributors
License: MPL-2.0 and BSD-3-clause and BSD-2-clause
Comment:
 Ported from librime-octagram (https://github.com/lotem/librime-octagram), commit 57d18b9f58e5284bd891d559f6bdd16cf60341e9, with the double-array reading reimplemented after the layout of darts-clone 0.32; both license texts are in resources/licenses/librime-octagram-BSD-3-Clause.txt.

Files: crates/engine/src/lattice/cxx_sort.rs
Copyright: LLVM Project contributors
 2026 Metasequoia IME contributors
License: MPL-2.0 and Apache-2.0 with LLVM exception
Comment:
 A step-by-step reproduction of sorts from LLVM libc++; the license text is resources/licenses/libcxx-Apache-2.0-WITH-LLVM-exception.txt.

Files: crates/engine/tests/golden/real/* crates/engine/src/handwriting/testdata/*
Copyright: 2026 Metasequoia IME contributors
 iDvel and the rime-ice contributors, and the other authors of the dictionary data listed in resources/licenses/msime-engine-dictionary-NOTICE.md
License: GPL-3.0-only
Comment:
 Test fixtures that only the engine's tests read, not compiled into the engine and outside its MPL-2.0: tests/golden/real holds candidate lists recorded against the dictionaries of tools/engine-golden/README.md, whose pinyin and English data come from rime-ice (GPL-3.0), and src/handwriting/testdata holds output of the zinnia-based handwriting reference implementation. They stay under the repository's GPL-3.0-only.

