Copyright: 2026 Metasequoia IME contributors
License: MIT
Comment:
 The script plugin SDK, its template and the script plugin collection, and the data of the official phrase tables, are under MIT so that plugins built with them need not be GPL; each of these directories carries the text as LICENSE.

